<title>CHINA: China Jan-Aug aluminium output up 1.34 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Aug aluminium output up 1.34 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's aluminium output totalled 1.0972 million tonnes in the first eight months of 1996, up by 1.34 percent compared with the same period last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Monday.</p>
<p>Aluminium production in August alone was 147,800 tonnes, the bureau said.</p>
